      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "YONDU BALE (1) carved over from wide out and boxed on strongly to finish 1.2 lengths away in second (25.55) behind Lektra Beta at Ballarat. Has performed well from this box with a win and two minor placings to his name from four starts. Racing well and deserves a win. PAW HADES (8) flew the lids with a fast early split but ran over at the finish when a narrow fifth (25.62) over 450m at this track. Has a strong record out of this box with two wins and a minor placing from five starts. Shapes as one to consider. HIGH COBBER (7) has been mixing form lately, hitting the frame two back before finishing seventh (25.57) at this track in a Grade 5 H. Expected to bounce back to best. LEKTRA EDGE (2) placed last time and is worth some thought.",
